ipants, coordinating data collection, overseeing research assistants, and managing and cleaning data. Building Services Specialist Denver, CO, Colorado Facilities Management & Planning, Maintenance / Grounds / Skilled Trades Under the general direct supervision of the Conversion Manager and the general direction of the Operations Manager of Auxiliary Facilities this position will be responsible for the performance of skilled labor tasks associated with the successful production of events and conversions in assembly facility environment. Skilled Trade Assistant Denver, CO, Colorado Facilities Management & Planning, Maintenance / Grounds / Skilled Trades Skilled individual who installs, maintains and repairs all types of equipment on the DU campus including HVAC, electrical and plumbing systems; in residential houses , dormitory, academic and research facilities. Sign up for job alerts Job Alert b9c5ce38 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Faculty Faculty Employment Type Adjunct Faculty Adjunct Faculty Locations Denver, CO, Colorado, United States Denver, CO, Colorado, United States First Name (required) e62c1958 Last Name (required) b8a14413 Email (required) 933f4991 Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Facebook X LinkedIn Instagram Youtube Copyright© 2026 University of Denver. | All rights reserved. | The University of Denver is an equal opportunity institution Cookie Preferences Privacy Policy Candidate Details We use cookies Some are necessary to operate the website and its functions. Others help personalise, improve content and services to show you the most relevant job opportunities. With the decision \"Accept essential only\" we will respect your privacy and will not set cookies that aren't necessary for the operation of the site. Accept essential on